  "findings": [
    "The uncorrected readiness gate is removed in this exact installed binary. Offline regression proves it no longer requires a model. This first live baseline completed four frames; host-observed ready tones5.709s versus prior6.338s are observations, not an isolated causal timing benchmark.",
